UITextHyperlink:HoverColor {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UITextHyperlink.h#UITextHyperlink:HoverColor
    src   "What the hovered link is drawn in, in place of the colour its markup gives it."
    text  "当鼠标悬停时，链接将以 HoverColor 绘制，取代其标记指定的颜色。关闭：链接在悬停或未悬停时外观相同。"
    state machine
}

UITextHyperlink:LinkStops {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UITextHyperlink.h#UITextHyperlink:LinkStops
    src   "The stops, each a child of the text's widget with a button on it, ignored by layout and never hit by a pointer: the\npointer reaches the links through the text itself. Paired by position with LinkStopTagIndices."
    text  "这些停靠点，每个都是文本控件的子项，上面带有一个按钮，不参与布局，也永远不会被指针命中：\n指针是通过文本本身来触达链接的。按位置与 LinkStopTagIndices 一一配对。"
    state machine
}

UITextHyperlink:PressedColor {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UITextHyperlink.h#UITextHyperlink:PressedColor
    src   "What the pressed link is drawn in, in place of the colour its markup gives it."
    text  "当链接被按下时，它将以 PressedColor 绘制，取代其标记指定的颜色。"
    state machine
}

